- **State sở hữu:** `users`, `userSearch`, `depositModal`, `depositAmount`, `deleteConfirm`
- **Functions:** [loadUsers](file:///I:/Website/Auto-like/src/pages/AdminPage.tsx#154-160), [handleDeposit](file:///I:/Website/Auto-like/src/pages/AdminPage.tsx#182-203), [handleDeleteUser](file:///I:/Website/Auto-like/src/pages/AdminPage.tsx#204-218), [toggleUserActive](file:///I:/Website/Auto-like/src/pages/AdminPage.tsx#219-226), [exportCsv('users')](file:///I:/Website/Auto-like/src/pages/AdminPage.tsx#292-304)
